-- RitsuScope: one colour per standard type (generated by scripts/standard-library/generate.mjs from colors.json).
-- Updates, for Brazil and the United States:
--   1. the standard types of the shared RitsuFlow library;
--   2. company copies of the standard ceiling/floor types that still have the old default colour and name
--      (types a company customised keep their colour);
--   3. takeoff items already drawn from those types that still have the type's old colour.
-- Safe to run more than once.
